## Computed Timeline ({{totalDuration}}s in total)

Format: the leading time range and parenthesized duration are on the final timeline. `source` is the timestamp range in the source media file. The bracketed number is the clip index for startClip/endClip references.

Clips:
{{#each clips}}
  {{this.timelineStart}}–{{this.timelineEnd}}s ({{this.duration}}s) vid={{this.videoId}} source={{this.start}}–{{this.end}} [{{this.index}}]
{{/each}}
{{#if voiceovers.length}}

Voiceovers:
{{#each voiceovers}}
  {{this.timelineStart}}–{{this.timelineEnd}}s vo={{this.voiceoverId}} ({{this.duration}}s)
{{/each}}
{{/if}}
{{#if overlays.length}}

Overlays:
{{#each overlays}}
  {{this.timelineStart}}–{{this.timelineEnd}}s "{{this.text}}" ({{this.duration}}s)
{{/each}}
{{/if}}
{{#if music.length}}

Music:
{{#each music}}
  {{this.timelineStart}}–{{this.timelineEnd}}s ({{this.duration}}s) music={{this.musicId}} source={{this.start}}–{{this.end}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}
